msgid ""
"I can only answer questions about published transit fare policies. If you "
"need other help, please contact the transit agency's customer service."
msgstr ""
"I can only answer questions about published transit fare policies. If you "
"need other help, please contact the transit agency's customer service."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"I wasn't sure which language you were using, so I'm answering in English. If"
" you'd like a different language, please ask again in that language."
msgstr ""
"I wasn't sure which language you were using, so I'm answering in English. If"
" you'd like a different language, please ask again in that language."

msgid ""
"I don't have a published policy document that answers that, and I won't "
"guess about fares or eligibility. Please check {where} for current "
"information."
msgstr ""
"I don't have a published policy document that answers that, and I won't "
"guess about fares or eligibility. Please check {where} for current "
"information."

msgid ""
"Please don't share personal details like ID numbers, contact information, or"
" birth dates — I don't need them to explain fare policy. Ask again without "
"the personal details, or contact the transit agency's customer service "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"Please don't share personal details like ID numbers, contact information, or"
" birth dates — I don't need them to explain fare policy. Ask again without "
"the personal details, or contact the transit agency's customer service "
"directly."

msgid ""
"That's outside what I can help with. I can explain published fare and "
"reduced-fare policies; for medical, immigration, or legal matters, please "
"contact the transit agency directly or a qualified professional."
msgstr ""
"That's outside what I can help with. I can explain published fare and "
"reduced-fare policies; for medical, immigration, or legal matters, please "
"contact the transit agency directly or a qualified professional."

msgid "the agency's website or customer service"
msgstr "the agency's website or customer service"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "your transit agency directly, or {statewide}"
msgstr "your transit agency directly, or {statewide}"

